WEBVTT

00:09:27.912 --> 00:09:31.496
and there being no Stacey Abrams in sight,

00:09:31.537 --> 00:09:33.287
they refused to seat him.

00:09:33.871 --> 00:09:37.246
And his case went up
to the US Supreme Court.

00:09:37.246 --> 00:09:38.537
And he won.

00:09:38.579 --> 00:09:39.746
He was seated.

00:09:39.746 --> 00:09:43.121
(Applause)

00:09:43.121 --> 00:09:45.704
Another early interview

00:09:45.746 --> 00:09:49.204
was of Tuskegee Airmen
Colonel Bill Thompson.

00:09:49.579 --> 00:09:52.454
We arrived at Colonel Thompson's house,

00:09:52.454 --> 00:09:54.704
and he had prepared for us

00:09:54.704 --> 00:09:56.787
for four days.

00:09:57.162 --> 00:09:59.662
He had boxes and boxes of material

00:09:59.704 --> 00:10:02.704
that are now housed
at the Air and Space Museum